{
  "server": "cn",
  "storyId": "act16d5_level_act16d5_01_end",
  "groupId": "act16d5",
  "stageId": "act16d5_01",
  "title": "初醒",
  "storyCode": "WR-1",
  "avgTag": "行动后",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/activities/act16d5/level_act16d5_01_end.txt",
  "sourceHash": "f7397647dfbd2df132c2c7cdd85ad3965ca357b5c151a7f8ce0b661ed69d5f46",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_plankroad"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "炎熔",
      "speakerId": "char_1011_purgatory",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这些东西......是什么？感染生物吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛丝",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_144",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "没有发现感染的迹象喔......而且说是生物，射穿它们的时候，它们就变成黑色的水渍消失了欸。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "炎熔",
      "speakerId": "char_1011_purgatory",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......某种法术？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛丝",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_144",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "有可能。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "炎熔",
      "speakerId": "char_1011_purgatory",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这样下去不行，数量太多了......得找出源头。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "炎熔",
      "speakerId": "char_1011_purgatory",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "它们是从哪个方向进入城镇的？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛丝",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_144",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "视野越来越暗了哦，小炎熔。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "炎熔",
      "speakerId": "char_1011_purgatory",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......我知道。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛丝",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_144",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "还要追吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛丝",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_144",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我们是怎么来到这里的还不清楚......情况有点诡异，我不太建议现在过于深入。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛丝",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_144",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "虽然这可能是个线索啦，但也不用这么着急。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "炎熔",
      "speakerId": "char_1011_purgatory",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乌有",
      "speakerId": "char_455_nothing",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "二位恩、恩人！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "炎熔",
      "speakerId": "char_1011_purgatory",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "呃，你怎么跟来了......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乌有",
      "speakerId": "char_455_nothing",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "什么话！怎么能抛下恩人自个儿跑路呢！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "炎熔",
      "speakerId": "char_1011_purgatory",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你知道那些东西是什么吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乌有",
      "speakerId": "char_455_nothing",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我、我也没见过啊......你看我腿都在打颤......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "炎熔",
      "speakerId": "char_1011_purgatory",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不是某种......炎国特产对吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乌有",
      "speakerId": "char_455_nothing",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哪能呢！这些奇形怪状的东西要是满地跑，早就变成轰动全国的大新闻咯！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "炎熔",
      "speakerId": "char_1011_purgatory",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......克洛丝，乌有，听我说。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "炎熔",
      "speakerId": "char_1011_purgatory",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我“完全记不得”推开那茅屋木门之后发生的事情，等到回过神来，就已经在那园林里听那个......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乌有",
      "speakerId": "char_455_nothing",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "煮伞居士。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "炎熔",
      "speakerId": "char_1011_purgatory",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "对，听那个煮伞居士说故事了。我对自己是怎么来到这里的一点印象都没有。以及，我也不知道这里是哪里。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛丝",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_144",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "大家都一样。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乌有",
      "speakerId": "char_455_nothing",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "恩人，有件事儿我倒是能确定，这里不是泥翁镇......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乌有",
      "speakerId": "char_455_nothing",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "虽然我也有几年没去过泥翁镇，但这儿的风土人情未免复古了些，刚才我一路跑过来，连个电缆都没有！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "炎熔",
      "speakerId": "char_1011_purgatory",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那更麻烦了......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛丝",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_144",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "就像做梦一样呢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "炎熔",
      "speakerId": "char_1011_purgatory",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛丝",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_144",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......我知道你在想什么，但是现在，我们没有其他办法，只能信任彼此。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乌有",
      "speakerId": "char_455_nothing",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "呃？恩人！你可别不信我啊！我绝不是那忘恩负义之徒！再说我也没那么大能耐啊！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "炎熔",
      "speakerId": "char_1011_purgatory",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我不是这个意思......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "炎熔",
      "speakerId": "char_1011_purgatory",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......只是考虑到目前的情况，这一切都太诡异了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛丝",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_144",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "没有不相信小乌有你哦，只是必须冷静下来想想各种各样的可能性。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛丝",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_144",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "大概还是某种陷阱吧，那么眼前这一切是不是真的......都很难说了嘛。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乌有",
      "speakerId": "char_455_nothing",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "恩人呐，别看我长得年轻，风流倜傥，但我年纪多半还是比你大的......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "炎熔",
      "speakerId": "char_1011_purgatory",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "源石技艺......也有可能。但难度太大了。是连通到了某个地方？还是干脆给我们施展了幻象......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乌有",
      "speakerId": "char_455_nothing",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "二位恩人果然是奇人呐，一般人遇到这种情况，哪能瞬间考虑到这个方向......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "炎熔",
      "speakerId": "char_1011_purgatory",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "“一般人”呢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "炎熔",
      "speakerId": "char_1011_purgatory",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "虽然不知道这里是哪里，但这里的地理情况太过反常......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "炎熔",
      "speakerId": "char_1011_purgatory",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "日月的位置相对固定，住房大都建在靠着黑夜的这一侧，农田和集市则在那边......但本地人似乎完全习以为常，还有刚才那些东西......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "炎熔",
      "speakerId": "char_1011_purgatory",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我们需要情报。越快越好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "炎熔",
      "speakerId": "char_1011_purgatory",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "钟又响了......？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛丝",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_144",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "只有在大炎和东国才能听到这种撞钟的声响呢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_landscape"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "粗犷的村民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_140",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "钟响了，响了！大家伙儿，没事了！都没事了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "警惕的村民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_140",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这么快？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "粗犷的村民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_140",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "没见到那些玩意的踪迹啦！我看到那几个外人帮我们赶走了那些怪物！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "警惕的村民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_140",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "他们竟然不怕那些玩意？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "粗犷的村民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_140",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "依我看，我们就该一鼓作气，打到那山里去，斩草除根！动不动就来上一遭，烦死个人！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "说书人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_138",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "话别这么说，不要太为难人了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "粗犷的村民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_140",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "啊，先生......您回来了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "说书人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_138",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "逸川，你立刻去找那三位英雄，请他们务必来我这儿叙上一叙。先前怠慢了他们，现在可得好好答谢一番。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "粗犷的村民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_140",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "好嘞！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_town"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": "char_362_Saga",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哎呀哎呀，小僧果然还是适合这撞钟的活计呀！住持爷爷要是知道小僧远在他乡还如此勤勉，一定会倍感欣慰的吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": "char_362_Saga",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嵯峨！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嵯峨",
      "speakerId": "char_362_Saga",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哦哦，掌柜的，你怎么来了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "掌柜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_139",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我听到钟声了，都结束了吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "掌柜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_139",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "听逸川叔说，有几位远道而来的客人帮忙保护了镇子，你有瞧见吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嵯峨",
      "speakerId": "char_362_Saga",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "没呢，小僧不是一直在这守着钟吗？不过要是像小僧的寺里那样有座钟楼，说不定还能远眺一番。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嵯峨",
      "speakerId": "char_362_Saga",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "话说回来，小僧来这儿也有段时日了，这还是第一次见到那些墨魉弄出如此大阵仗，如此巧合？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "掌柜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_139",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "所以我才想请你去见见那些外乡人呀。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嵯峨",
      "speakerId": "char_362_Saga",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哦？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ],
  "observedOperators": [
